  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/yYXNKdtq/minecraft-title.png\" alt=\"Title\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252f2dwisp.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Bluesky-Follow-448DEE?style=for-the-badge&logo=bluesky&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545\" alt=\"Bluesky\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252f2DWisp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Xwitter-Follow-1A1A1A?style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545\" alt=\"Xwitter\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252f2dwisp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-Support-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/simple-grass-flowers?style=for-the-badge&label=Modrinth&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/simple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/551206?style=for-the-badge&label=CurseForge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545&color=F1641E\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<h2>🌻 简介：</h2>\n<p>为草方块、菌丝土和灰化土添加花朵、石头、三叶草及其他与原版风格相符的细节装饰。</p>\n<p>本资源包无需安装任何模组即可使用，但如果搭配 Optifine 或 Continuity 模组，沼泽、苍白花园和樱花林生物群系中的花朵渲染会更加协调。</p>\n<p>如果你希望使用较矮的草侧面贴图，可以与本包同时安装我的另一款资源包 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-lower-grass-sides\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Lower Grass Sides</a>！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">如果你需要 Bare Bones 兼容版本，请改装此款资源包。</a></p>\n<h2>🎨 我的所有作品：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fartisanal-default\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wisp's Reworked Vanilla</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fwisps-colourful-wildflowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wisp's Colourful Wildflowers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Grass Flowers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones Grass Flowers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-lower-grass-sides\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Lower Grass Sides</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffancy-full-block-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fancy Full Block Grass</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fartisanal-nether-bricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artisanal Nether Bricks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-rustic-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Rustic Glass</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fraven-phantoms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raven Phantoms</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-breeze-rod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Breeze Rods</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🤔 常见问题：</h2>\n<p><strong>问：如何安装本资源包？</strong><br>\n答：请参考 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fblog%252fhow-to-install-minecraft-texture-packs-4615399%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">本指南</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>问：能移植到基岩版吗？</strong><br>\n答：目前我没有移植到基岩版的计划。</p>\n<p><strong>问：可以让别人移植到基岩版吗？</strong><br>\n答：不可以，我不允许他人对我的资源包进行第三方移植。</p>\n<p><strong>问：能添加这个功能吗？</strong><br>\n答：有可能！在评论区提出你的建议，我们会酌情考虑。</p>\n<p><strong>问：我发现了 bug！</strong><br>\n答：请在评论区反馈所有 bug，我会尽快修复。</p>\n<p><strong>问：本资源包支持 X 版本吗？</strong><br>\n答：这要看具体情况。有时旧版本也能完美运行，有时则不行。本资源包的部分功能需要依赖仅在较新版本中才有的特性，或使用与早期版本不同的文件命名。一般来说，本资源包大致可用的最低版本为 <strong>1.15</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>问：能在服务端上使用吗？</strong><br>\n答：可以！本资源包在服务端上运行良好，其风格足够贴近原版，即使搭配原版建造也能保持良好的视觉效果，反之亦然。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fjamie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">如果你需要服务器，可以通过我的联盟链接获取！</a></p>\n<p><strong>问：我可以将它加入自己的模组包吗？</strong><br>\n答：当然可以！但请注明原作者（你也应该为所有作者署名），并且不得将我的作品据为己有。</p>",
